WEBVTT

01:28.338 --> 01:29.839
You poor things.

01:30.632 --> 01:32.926
Here child, take this and eat.

01:33.009 --> 01:34.177
Oh, my dear!

01:42.227 --> 01:43.770
I'll get you some more to eat.

01:44.354 --> 01:45.522
Please take your time.

02:26.521 --> 02:27.355
Mom.

03:20.241 --> 03:21.326
Geon!

03:24.913 --> 03:27.916
You were to come to me if anything changed
to the body I put his soul into.

03:27.999 --> 03:29.500
How could you let things get like this?

03:29.584 --> 03:32.337
If he devouts another soul,
he can go back to normal.

03:32.420 --> 03:33.922
You have to give him a chance.

03:34.005 --> 03:35.798
Your son has run wild.
He can't be controlled.

03:39.802 --> 03:41.387
I'll have to take back his soul.

03:41.471 --> 03:43.890
You can't! You can't.

03:43.973 --> 03:46.434
You're the one
who turned my son into a soul shifter.

03:46.517 --> 03:48.686
Either find a body
for his soul to go into,

03:48.770 --> 03:50.939
or find someone
whose energy he can consume.

03:51.773 --> 03:52.857
Please, save him!

03:53.358 --> 03:55.026
You have to save my baby boy!

03:55.944 --> 03:58.029
If anyone finds out I used this sorcery,

03:59.072 --> 04:00.698
the two of us will be finished.

04:01.449 --> 04:02.367
No!

04:02.992 --> 04:03.868
No!

04:09.707 --> 04:10.583
Geon.

04:11.459 --> 04:14.128
Please, hold on! Just a little longer!

04:14.671 --> 04:15.546
Honey.

05:28.161 --> 05:31.873
When a soul shifter loses control,
why do their bodies turn to stone?

05:31.956 --> 05:35.126
When the switched body
and the souls clash, a crack forms.

05:36.294 --> 05:38.379
And the body starts losing its energy.

05:38.963 --> 05:41.215
This will make eight soul shifters
who've already run wild.

05:42.175 --> 05:44.427
I think I need to
stop performing the alchemy of souls.

05:45.219 --> 05:47.013
I think you need to
immediately go to the royal palace.

05:48.264 --> 05:51.809
His Highness has requested
information regarding the new spell

05:51.893 --> 05:53.353
that you've been working on.

06:28.513 --> 06:29.514
I've heard…

06:30.598 --> 06:33.059
you've been trying to master a new spell.

06:33.935 --> 06:35.520
Just some part of the tricks for fun,

06:35.603 --> 06:37.605
it's hardly something
I would call a spell.

06:38.231 --> 06:41.067
I know that I can not wish
to live any longer.

06:41.567 --> 06:42.735
However,

06:42.819 --> 06:45.988
I can only regret that I have no heir.

06:46.823 --> 06:48.825
I will pray that
you recover your strength.

06:49.617 --> 06:52.120
It is too late
for this sickly body.

06:52.912 --> 06:54.956
If I could just leave it,

06:56.207 --> 06:59.836
and find another that was younger
and healthier than my own.

07:01.921 --> 07:04.757
How could a person possibly change
the body they were born into?

07:08.052 --> 07:10.054
But you're able to do it, can't you?

07:14.392 --> 07:15.977
The alchemy of souls.

07:24.026 --> 07:25.903
The alchemy of soul is forbidden magic.

07:25.987 --> 07:28.823
If the soul and body clash,
one could transform into a demon.

07:29.365 --> 07:30.533
Into whose body

07:31.033 --> 07:33.578
would I even dare
to place Your Majesty's soul?

07:33.661 --> 07:36.080
What if you place my soul into your body?

07:39.250 --> 07:41.252
Not for long. Just seven days.

07:41.794 --> 07:43.713
Switch souls for a week.

07:46.883 --> 07:49.802
I heard that even a soul
that you place into a corpse…

07:50.761 --> 07:53.055
could live in it
for more than half a year.

07:54.599 --> 07:58.769
Between the soul of a king
and the body of his greatest mage,

07:58.853 --> 08:00.354
what is there to worry about?

08:01.564 --> 08:04.942
After seven days,
then you can go and undo this spell.

08:08.237 --> 08:09.989
Now that you've mastered
the alchemy of souls,

08:10.072 --> 08:12.783
something that only
the greatest mages can do,

08:14.076 --> 08:17.955
why waste your time
transplanting souls into decaying corpses?

08:22.793 --> 08:24.003
Jang Gang.

08:24.712 --> 08:26.380
Shift your soul into your king.

11:06.832 --> 11:09.377
His Majesty's soul
and mine have been shifted.

11:18.636 --> 11:20.429
I have gone to be with Do-hwa.

11:20.930 --> 11:23.474
When she bears a child,
know that it is mine.

11:25.976 --> 11:26.811
Do-hwa.

11:31.649 --> 11:32.566
Do-hwa.

11:34.235 --> 11:35.695
You truly are beautiful.

11:46.914 --> 11:49.041
No, you can't do that!

11:53.963 --> 11:56.799
Don't do this to me!
You can't do this to me!

11:57.466 --> 11:58.676
You can't!

12:20.281 --> 12:23.451
The energy of the sky
which reigns over the wind,

12:23.534 --> 12:24.994
the rain, the clouds,

12:25.077 --> 12:26.120
touched the land

12:27.079 --> 12:29.498
and created a massive surge of energy.

12:29.582 --> 12:33.043
And with Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
keeping it contained at its center, 

12:33.127 --> 12:34.086
a country was built.

12:34.587 --> 12:38.799
Because of the country's great lake,
the nation was named Daeho.

12:40.092 --> 12:43.471
There are people who can control
the energy of heaven and earth,

12:43.554 --> 12:45.306
and they were called mages.

12:47.141 --> 12:50.394
This tale is a story
about the mages of Daeho,

12:50.478 --> 12:53.689
a place that cannot be found
in history or with a map.

13:08.412 --> 13:12.082
20 YEARS LATER

13:21.509 --> 13:22.927
So Naksu, the Shadow Assassin

13:23.010 --> 13:25.095
who's been cutting down
mages across the city

13:25.721 --> 13:26.639
is really you.

13:27.139 --> 13:31.101
Everywhere I go,
heads roll, so that's why I chose

13:31.185 --> 13:32.186
"Naksu".

13:33.103 --> 13:34.814
A beautiful name, is it not?

13:36.023 --> 13:37.066
Fire.

13:39.527 --> 13:40.402
Fire!

16:38.706 --> 16:40.165
We can't let her escape.

16:40.833 --> 16:42.334
- Capture her.
- Yes, sir!

16:55.222 --> 16:56.849
This way. Come on.

17:07.484 --> 17:08.569
She's over there!

17:58.410 --> 17:59.661
I can't die this way.

18:01.080 --> 18:01.997
Not like this!

18:08.837 --> 18:10.297
Uh, long time no see!

18:10.380 --> 18:12.299
Come on!
Look at his face. Bummer!

18:12.382 --> 18:13.842
What are you drinking?

18:23.143 --> 18:24.353
For God's sake!

18:25.729 --> 18:26.855
What's her problem?

18:28.148 --> 18:29.316
Hey, hey, hey!

18:30.442 --> 18:31.693
What are you doing?

19:02.474 --> 19:03.767
TAVERN

19:11.358 --> 19:12.526
She is already dead.

19:33.839 --> 19:35.591
There's no blue mark of a soul shifter.

19:39.386 --> 19:41.972
But there are still signs
of her soul leaving.

19:43.348 --> 19:44.683
The alchemy of souls…

19:45.976 --> 19:47.227
was not successful.

20:16.298 --> 20:21.136
SONGRIM

20:24.598 --> 20:25.474
One.

20:27.935 --> 20:28.769
Two.

20:30.520 --> 20:31.355
Three.

20:49.248 --> 20:50.123
Hmm.

20:50.958 --> 20:53.502
Yul, come and take a look.

20:57.714 --> 20:58.715
Is this Naksu?

21:00.092 --> 21:00.926
Correct.

21:02.469 --> 21:05.138
This here is the mark of a soul shifter.

21:06.181 --> 21:09.059
Now, take note!
When the alchemy of souls is performed,

21:09.142 --> 21:12.854
right above the heart,
there will be a blue bruise like this.

21:13.939 --> 21:16.858
If she is the alchemy of souls,
does that mean she's still out there?

21:16.942 --> 21:20.445
It seems that she did cast the spell,
but it must have failed.

21:21.071 --> 21:23.323
While there are traces
of the soul leaving the body,

21:23.407 --> 21:27.286
there weren't any signs that she shifted
into the girl's body that she captured.

21:37.421 --> 21:38.297
It's a whistle.

21:38.964 --> 21:39.840
A whistle?

21:39.923 --> 21:42.843
Long ago when I had pet birds,
I used a whistle like this.

21:44.761 --> 21:47.180
Did this woman own a pet bird?

21:47.264 --> 21:49.266
Looks like she's carried it
with her for quite a while.

21:50.017 --> 21:51.852
Seems to be
pretty important to her.

21:52.477 --> 21:57.190
Even an assassin who roams around
beheading people with ease is still human.

21:57.274 --> 22:00.277
She must have had
quite the story of her own.

22:08.160 --> 22:10.620
Naksu's body has already
been seen by many people.

22:10.704 --> 22:13.081
Soon, everyone will be talking
about the alchemy of souls.

22:13.749 --> 22:16.918
Has it been 20 years
since the last soul shifter?

22:17.002 --> 22:17.961
Yes, it has.

22:18.628 --> 22:22.924
Mm. That soul shifter who ran wild
and killed all those people…

22:23.800 --> 22:27.095
I am beginning to fear
something like that will happen again.

22:27.721 --> 22:29.181
Uncle!

22:29.264 --> 22:30.098
Uncle.

22:31.933 --> 22:34.686
Uncle, is it true Naksu's a soul shifter?

22:35.270 --> 22:37.189
Master! Master Heo, did you see it too?

22:37.272 --> 22:40.734
You're a little excited, aren't you?
Especially to spread some rumor around?

22:40.817 --> 22:43.487
The rumors are already spreading.
Everyone's talking about it.

22:44.154 --> 22:45.947
- Where from?
- At Chwiseonru.

22:46.031 --> 22:47.741
So, instead of training
like you should be,

22:47.824 --> 22:49.659
this Jeongjingak's mage
has just been hanging around

22:49.743 --> 22:51.620
and visiting taverns
and engaging with rumors.

22:53.163 --> 22:57.459
Well, Songrim Jeongjingak can be
an excellent place for mages to train.

22:57.542 --> 23:00.504
It can also be a great place
to gather information.

23:00.587 --> 23:05.300
Furthermore, Dang-gu would be next in line
to take your place as Songrim's leader,

23:05.384 --> 23:07.469
and the business man
who will lead our home.

23:07.552 --> 23:09.346
- He'll need to know how to drink.
- Mm.

23:09.429 --> 23:10.514
So, now, you tell me.

23:11.098 --> 23:14.267
What drink at Chwiseonru
do you think is best?

23:14.351 --> 23:17.437
Honestly, I don't go there much
since Uk isn't there.

23:17.521 --> 23:19.940
"Uk"? Jang Uk, the son of Jang Gang?

23:20.023 --> 23:23.985
But isn't he learning Jujang scribe
at a bookstore that's in Yeongchundang?

23:24.069 --> 23:26.154
It's been forever
since he's been kicked out of there.

23:26.238 --> 23:28.156
He's over in Gisan, still. I believe.

23:28.240 --> 23:31.952
Training under the Monk Ho-yeon.
I'm the one who sent him there.

23:32.744 --> 23:37.332
Oh! So, Jang Uk, this time,
is training in a temple now.

23:38.750 --> 23:41.420
Today will be
my last day of training here.

23:43.088 --> 23:45.590
You are nowhere
near finished with your training.

23:45.674 --> 23:48.969
How dare a student speak of
ending his studies in front of his master.

23:49.052 --> 23:50.887
You told me I need to fill
my head with knowledge,

23:50.971 --> 23:53.348
so I memorized every
single word of hundreds of spell books.

23:53.432 --> 23:55.100
You told me to sharpen my mind,

23:55.183 --> 23:57.811
so I sharpened hundreds of knives
until the whetstone wore down.

23:57.894 --> 24:01.815
But you never actually… taught me
how to cast a single spell, did you?

24:02.399 --> 24:04.776
The only lesson
your pupil has ever learned here

24:04.860 --> 24:07.529
is that his master
had no genuine intention

24:07.612 --> 24:09.364
of ever teaching him real magic at all.

24:09.948 --> 24:12.409
And hence why,
having learned this valuable lesson,

24:12.492 --> 24:14.161
your pupil will be taking his leave.

24:14.661 --> 24:17.873
The leader of Songrim requested
I keep you here three years.

24:17.956 --> 24:21.168
You're using my training fees
to pay to build the new sanctuary, right?

24:21.251 --> 24:24.212
I will not ask for you to return it,
so I hope it goes well for you.

24:25.755 --> 24:29.050
I did not give you permission
to end your training. How dare you?

24:31.136 --> 24:34.639
Do I seem to be…
asking for permission right now?

24:36.766 --> 24:40.562
Conceived by your mother's affair
and abandoned by your father.

24:40.645 --> 24:43.648
I never should have expected you
to understand the bond of duty.

24:43.732 --> 24:46.485
It is I who refuses
to teach a boy like you.

24:47.527 --> 24:49.696
I may not know much about a pupil's duty,

24:49.779 --> 24:51.406
but I know how to be a creditor.

24:51.490 --> 24:53.116
So, if you try saying another word,

24:53.200 --> 24:55.368
your sanctuary will have
no roof to put on.

24:56.995 --> 24:58.705
As I'll be taking my money back.

24:59.498 --> 25:01.041
It's your father's fault

25:01.124 --> 25:04.252
that no master anywhere would dare
to teach you how to cast spells.

25:04.336 --> 25:06.880
Okay, thank you
for worrying about me, master.

25:07.923 --> 25:11.426
But by myself, I… will find
a master who'll guide me.

25:12.177 --> 25:15.430
Someone skilled and extremely strong.

25:32.572 --> 25:34.241
Mu-deok, are you all right?

26:35.135 --> 26:38.054
Of all people,
why did I enter this body?

26:39.639 --> 26:40.890
What's wrong with you?

26:40.974 --> 26:42.851
I was certain
that this woman was blind.

26:48.356 --> 26:50.191
So then, why am I able to see?

26:50.817 --> 26:52.652
Is it because our soul shifted bodies?

26:55.322 --> 26:58.158
I can't find the blue mark
of a soul shifter anywhere on her body.

26:58.241 --> 26:59.659
Is it possible?

27:00.702 --> 27:03.788
If you're feeling sick, just hang on!
We're nearly there, Mu-deok.

27:06.333 --> 27:07.292
"Mu-deok."

27:07.375 --> 27:11.004
A blind country girl from Sari Village
bought to be sold off in the fortress.

27:14.132 --> 27:15.383
Sit down. You'll fall.

27:26.269 --> 27:27.979
Thanks for getting me here safely.

27:29.105 --> 27:30.106
But I'll be going now.

27:42.535 --> 27:43.745
What is wrong with me?

27:44.371 --> 27:45.288
I have no strength.

27:46.498 --> 27:48.917
Is this body so weak
it can't even climb over this?

27:51.002 --> 27:52.170
My arms are shaking.

27:52.253 --> 27:55.298
Mister! Please! Come and help me, please!

27:55.382 --> 27:56.549
What? Mu-deok!

27:56.633 --> 27:58.385
- Mister, please!
- Oh, what did you do? Just--

27:58.468 --> 28:00.762
- Just hold on! Hold on…
- Please, Mister!

28:00.845 --> 28:03.515
Turn around!
Turn around! Hurry! Turn around!

28:03.598 --> 28:04.599
- What the hell?
- I'm coming, Mu-deok!

28:04.683 --> 28:06.351
- Jus a little longer!
- I'm slipping.

28:06.434 --> 28:07.477
Aargh! Mister!

28:19.406 --> 28:21.032
Why would someone
who can't even see

28:21.116 --> 28:23.451
try to dangle off a bridge like that?

28:23.535 --> 28:25.286
You could've gotten hurt.

28:26.705 --> 28:28.164
This is a huge problem.

28:28.248 --> 28:30.083
All of my power is gone.

28:35.547 --> 28:37.048
Motion sickness?

28:37.716 --> 28:40.927
What are we gonna do?
I can't believe how weak you are.

28:41.511 --> 28:42.929
He's right. I'm weak!

28:43.012 --> 28:45.056
This body is completely useless.

28:46.141 --> 28:49.728
I'll have to wait to run away
and remain as Mu-deok for now.

28:49.811 --> 28:52.188
I'm very sorry, Mister.

28:52.272 --> 28:53.523
It is all right.

28:53.606 --> 28:55.358
Just be more careful! You're too frail.

28:55.984 --> 28:57.193
Let's get you something to eat.

29:10.039 --> 29:11.875
- Please, enjoy your meal.
- Yes, thank you.

29:11.958 --> 29:14.753
Come on! Let's eat!
It's chicken. Eat as much as you want.

29:15.503 --> 29:18.339
As an assassin,
I must be sensitive to the smell of blood.

29:18.423 --> 29:21.968
Therefore, I can not eat any creature
that sheds blood like a human.

29:22.051 --> 29:24.304
- No, thank you.
- Just eat.

29:31.561 --> 29:34.314
I've never eaten meat before. It is…

29:35.607 --> 29:36.524
so delicious.

29:41.571 --> 29:42.655
Eat up.

29:42.739 --> 29:45.825
Really… really didn't want
to send you there,

29:46.451 --> 29:49.954
but it's the only place that would
take in someone blind like yourself.

29:51.748 --> 29:52.582
What do you mean?

29:53.458 --> 29:54.542
Where's "there"?

29:56.920 --> 29:59.464
An elderly woman
in Sari Village took her in

29:59.547 --> 30:00.715
after she lost her parents.

30:00.799 --> 30:02.967
But she got sick and passed away.

30:03.051 --> 30:05.512
All of her debt was passed onto this girl,

30:05.595 --> 30:07.514
so that's why she came here to be sold.

30:07.597 --> 30:08.556
I'm off, then.

30:10.058 --> 30:11.810
How could you sell
this unfortunate kid to a brothel?

30:11.893 --> 30:14.270
- I wish you well.
- Wait! Don't…

30:16.439 --> 30:18.233
I can't believe he fed me chicken

30:18.316 --> 30:19.526
just to sell me to this place.

30:19.609 --> 30:22.946
Once I get my strength back, I will
tear you apart like a piece of chicken.

30:23.029 --> 30:24.781
Oh, you are far too skinny.

30:25.281 --> 30:28.117
I wonder if you'd be prettier
if we fattened you up just a bit.

30:28.201 --> 30:30.620
Don't bother. This body can't
possibly get any prettier.

30:31.204 --> 30:33.748
Do you see how ugly I am?
I don't belong in a brothel.

30:33.832 --> 30:35.250
You better just sell me somewhere else.

30:35.333 --> 30:37.460
Well, you're well-spoken.
That's for certain.

30:38.044 --> 30:39.212
I hear that you can sing.

30:39.295 --> 30:41.673
Are you good? As good as you can talk?

30:44.342 --> 30:46.803
Oh, we'd better wash you first
and dress you up.

31:01.651 --> 31:03.403
You didn't tell me
that you could dance, too!

31:03.486 --> 31:05.113
You think I'm dancing right now?

31:05.989 --> 31:09.659
If I had any power in my steps,
your arm would have been ripped clean off.

31:11.661 --> 31:14.914
You can't speak to your elders
like that. It's really rude!

31:14.998 --> 31:17.500
You'll be in big trouble
if you treat customers like that.

31:17.584 --> 31:19.961
Just wait.
I promise I'll kill you.

31:21.170 --> 31:25.008
We have a lot of powerful people
who come and visit our parlor.

31:25.633 --> 31:28.803
The Four Seasons of Daeho
are regulars of Chwiseonru.

31:29.971 --> 31:31.097
The four what?

31:31.180 --> 31:34.475
In Daeho, there are four houses,
each represented by an heir.

31:34.559 --> 31:37.061
And they are known as the Four Seasons.

31:51.034 --> 31:53.328
There's the daughter
from the Jin family

31:53.411 --> 31:55.413
who has the vitality of spring.

31:55.496 --> 31:57.040
Jin Cho-yeon.

32:11.471 --> 32:15.475
The heir to the Park family
whose energy is hot like summer.

32:15.558 --> 32:16.768
Park Dang-gu.

32:27.028 --> 32:32.075
The genius of the Seo family who is
as noble as the setting sun in fall.

32:32.158 --> 32:33.159
Seo Yul.

32:50.635 --> 32:54.555
And then, there is
the Jang family's successor

32:54.639 --> 32:58.601
who is as dazzling
as the winter snow, Jang Uk.

33:06.401 --> 33:09.988
The Jin, the Park, the Seo,
and the Jang families are the four

33:10.071 --> 33:12.281
most important mage dynasties
in all of Daeho.

33:12.365 --> 33:14.367
And their children are the Four Seasons.

33:15.451 --> 33:18.121
So do they call them
the Four Seasons inside the fortress?

33:20.081 --> 33:21.958
It looks like
my summer prince is here now!

33:27.630 --> 33:30.258
If he really is
the heir of the Park family,

33:30.341 --> 33:32.635
then he must be
the nephew of Songrim's Park Jin.

33:34.762 --> 33:36.055
Park Jin.

33:39.684 --> 33:42.645
He was there on that horrible night.

33:51.612 --> 33:52.822
The Jin family.

33:53.656 --> 33:54.866
The Seo family.

33:55.408 --> 33:56.617
The Jang family.

33:57.368 --> 33:58.578
The Park family.

34:07.962 --> 34:09.005
The Four Seasons?

34:10.465 --> 34:14.302
Wherever Naksu may go,
you all will be defeated…

34:17.430 --> 34:20.308
beautifully, just like your name.

34:23.269 --> 34:26.522
Was there a particular reason
that you decided to join us today?

34:26.606 --> 34:30.443
My uncle told me
I had to come and get someone.

34:31.027 --> 34:33.196
Get someone? Who is it?

34:33.279 --> 34:35.907
Some trainee who just came from Gisan,

34:35.990 --> 34:38.910
who embarrassed his master
and then was expelled.

34:40.036 --> 34:42.538
I'm certain he's hiding around here.

34:43.206 --> 34:45.041
Oh, well, well, well, well!

34:45.124 --> 34:48.377
That's funny. It seems to me
someone craves seafood…

34:48.461 --> 34:49.504
…after being stuck

34:49.587 --> 34:50.463
in the mountain for so long.

34:50.546 --> 34:52.423
Mm-hmm. That must be his room, then.

35:12.193 --> 35:13.194
Wow!

35:14.445 --> 35:16.072
Thanks to all your hard work,

35:16.155 --> 35:18.199
my uncle now has to go
all the way up to Gisan

35:18.282 --> 35:19.784
and beg for that monk's forgiveness.

35:19.867 --> 35:21.911
Meanwhile, you're just
sitting here, all alone,

35:21.994 --> 35:24.622
enjoying this delicious-looking crab.

35:24.705 --> 35:26.332
No, I haven't eaten it yet.

35:26.415 --> 35:27.792
It's too much of a hassle.

35:28.376 --> 35:30.711
You came at the perfect time.
Cast something to break the shell.

35:31.712 --> 35:32.922
Whoa, you…

35:33.005 --> 35:34.215
You want to use a violent spell

35:34.298 --> 35:37.009
just so you can rip the crab meat
from its shell. There is one!

35:37.093 --> 35:39.762
But instead of the crab, hmm,
I think I'd rather use it on you.

35:39.846 --> 35:43.266
Dang-gu, if that monk had taught me
a spell to remove a crab shell,

35:43.349 --> 35:45.351
I know that I wouldn't have left
the way I did.

35:45.434 --> 35:47.103
Even if he taught you,
could you actually do it?

35:47.186 --> 35:49.105
I mean, you father still has
your gate of energy blocked.

35:49.188 --> 35:50.773
Then he should have opened it.

35:50.857 --> 35:52.775
That's what masters do
for their students, right?

35:52.859 --> 35:54.360
They need to open what's blocked.

35:54.443 --> 35:57.238
No one in Daeho is
bold enough or brave enough

35:57.321 --> 35:59.365
to even try to go against
your father to open your gate for you.

35:59.448 --> 36:01.033
There are fearless people, though.

36:01.117 --> 36:02.618
For example, there is…

36:03.286 --> 36:05.204
… the Shadow Assassin called Naksu.

36:09.792 --> 36:11.294
Do not be ridiculous.

36:11.377 --> 36:14.046
Are you saying she's not skilled?
Even the leader had a tough time with her.

36:15.339 --> 36:16.674
She is dead, very dead.

36:17.341 --> 36:19.051
I heard that she performed
the alchemy of souls,

36:19.135 --> 36:20.178
so she might be alive.

36:21.637 --> 36:22.972
Uh, where did you hear that from?

36:23.681 --> 36:26.267
Do you really think
I just came here to eat some crab, huh?

36:26.350 --> 36:29.520
Any news in Daeho can be heard
at Chwiseonru before Jeongjingak.

36:30.396 --> 36:31.814
Just crack it open already, will you?

36:31.898 --> 36:33.441
If you already knew the spell

36:33.524 --> 36:34.692
to shelling the crabs,
it's the least you can do.

36:34.775 --> 36:36.068
And you should be able
to pull the crab meat out

36:36.152 --> 36:38.029
with your own hands, right?
You lazy ass!

36:41.532 --> 36:44.035
You look so pretty now
that you're washed and cleaned up.

36:44.118 --> 36:45.286
I'll do your makeup now.

36:46.495 --> 36:48.998
Thank you, but I can do it myself.

36:49.081 --> 36:50.374
But you can't even see.

36:50.458 --> 36:52.543
Do you really think
you can do it on your own?

36:52.627 --> 36:54.962
I've never done anything
like this before,

36:55.046 --> 36:57.173
so I need time to get ready emotionally.

36:58.633 --> 37:00.718
I'd like to be alone for a moment.

37:02.678 --> 37:04.931
Of course! Just come out
when you're ready.

37:16.025 --> 37:18.277
It's a lot easier
to fool people in this woman's body.

37:19.487 --> 37:21.113
To make my escape,
I'll need some money.

37:23.658 --> 37:25.117
Is this real gold?

37:26.661 --> 37:28.162
This one's made of jade.

37:28.996 --> 37:31.582
Mu-deok, I want you
to try this new shade.

37:33.709 --> 37:34.585
What are you doing?

37:36.128 --> 37:38.839
Ju-wol, what is wrong?

37:41.425 --> 37:43.010
Can you see me?

37:52.395 --> 37:54.897
Someone go grab her!
Catch that thief!

38:00.695 --> 38:01.988
It's way too high.

38:10.329 --> 38:11.247
Here!

38:34.979 --> 38:36.480
What are you looking at?

38:54.415 --> 38:55.416
You're…

39:03.341 --> 39:04.467
Don't try to make a sound.

39:06.719 --> 39:09.388
I'd heard that they just
brought a girl who was unable to see.

39:10.056 --> 39:11.098
But you can.

39:14.101 --> 39:15.770
I think I might have heard of your name.

39:15.853 --> 39:17.980
What was it again?
It starts with a D, right?

39:18.064 --> 39:19.148
No! No, it's not!

39:20.483 --> 39:21.692
Oh, that's right!

39:22.610 --> 39:23.486
Mu-deok.

39:25.279 --> 39:27.573
That's right. My name is Mu-deok.

39:28.449 --> 39:30.576
And now that I've gotten
a good look at your face,

39:31.243 --> 39:33.537
if you do not stay quiet
until I get out of here,

39:33.621 --> 39:35.414
I will come back here
and slit your throat.

39:39.293 --> 39:40.378
What's so funny?

39:42.505 --> 39:43.631
Your beautiful eyes.

39:46.509 --> 39:47.551
Just stop that now!

39:48.677 --> 39:52.098
Uh, sorry. Only your eyes are pretty.

39:53.641 --> 39:54.767
You must be crazy.

40:01.732 --> 40:02.566
Mu-deok.

40:03.275 --> 40:04.151
Mu-deok!

40:06.195 --> 40:08.656
Hey, hey! There's not much
to take in there.

40:10.699 --> 40:11.617
Take this!

40:12.910 --> 40:13.911
Take this instead.

40:15.538 --> 40:16.914
Here!

40:16.997 --> 40:18.040
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, hey…

40:37.726 --> 40:40.354
- What are you looking at? Huh?
- Nothing.

40:45.734 --> 40:46.694
Park Dang-gu.

40:48.404 --> 40:51.157
I heard the Shadow Assassin,
Naksu, used Tansu to fight.

40:51.240 --> 40:53.159
Do you even know what Tansu is?

40:53.242 --> 40:55.744
Mm, yes, I read a bit about it.

40:56.245 --> 40:57.163
TANSU

40:57.872 --> 40:59.206
Tansu, you see,

40:59.290 --> 41:02.835
is a style of swordsmanship that only
the best mages can attempt to practice.

41:02.918 --> 41:05.880
Just like you can flick water,
you can flick your energy with your blade.

41:05.963 --> 41:08.424
Even a single move
could be enough to end your life.

41:18.350 --> 41:20.102
Wait, hold on.
Why do you ask?

41:21.187 --> 41:22.438
I was wondering whether or not

41:22.521 --> 41:24.648
I almost got killed
by this crab like just now.

41:24.732 --> 41:27.568
Ah, give it here!
Come on! Give it, I'll de-shell it for--

41:29.111 --> 41:32.239
Hey, Jang Uk, that's a critical hit.

41:33.824 --> 41:35.075
That's my vital point.

41:35.159 --> 41:37.369
In one move, she aimed at my vital point.

41:40.456 --> 41:41.957
But that's it.

41:42.041 --> 41:43.876
Then why did she fall off?

41:48.589 --> 41:51.133
How is it that
this tiny body is always so hungry, 

41:51.217 --> 41:52.468
no matter how much I eat?

41:52.551 --> 41:54.720
I'll only get weak if I let myself starve.

41:55.221 --> 41:56.597
Guess there's no choice, then.

41:56.680 --> 41:57.515
Ah!

42:07.316 --> 42:09.902
Now is not the time to fight. Keep it in.

42:15.407 --> 42:17.618
Look! It's mages
from Jeongjingak.

42:24.875 --> 42:26.961
I heard that an assassin entered
Songrim Jeongjingak.

42:27.044 --> 42:28.963
I heard that she was
after the leader, but was killed.

42:29.046 --> 42:30.798
The assassin is a young woman.

42:30.881 --> 42:32.174
Oh, my!

43:04.081 --> 43:06.041
He must have
already seen my dead body.

43:06.584 --> 43:08.335
He wouldn't recognize me anyway.

43:09.169 --> 43:10.129
That whistle…

43:10.754 --> 43:12.548
he wouldn't have remembered that either.

43:22.182 --> 43:24.643
There's no sign that
Naksu travelled through here.

43:25.603 --> 43:28.397
However, it seems like
she failed to shift souls.

43:29.481 --> 43:32.234
Even if she were to succeed,
she's probably in hiding

43:32.318 --> 43:34.612
because she encountered a problem.

43:34.695 --> 43:37.489
An assassin whose identity
has been revealed must be forsaken.

43:39.950 --> 43:41.827
We need to retrieve her body and sword.

43:41.910 --> 43:44.246
Destroy any trace of Naksu
that's left behind.

43:44.330 --> 43:48.292
If somehow she's still alive,
what should I do, then?

43:49.835 --> 43:52.254
She'll either be found
as a soul shifter and killed,

43:52.338 --> 43:56.300
or she'll run wild as her soul
and new body clash until she is stoned.

43:56.884 --> 43:59.178
I trained her to become
the ultimate assassin.

44:00.512 --> 44:01.472
What a pity!

44:09.855 --> 44:11.440
How much more do you need to study it?

44:11.523 --> 44:15.486
These are pricey.
I need to inspect them closely.

44:15.569 --> 44:18.864
I don't need much money for it.
Just pay me a rough estimate, okay?

44:21.241 --> 44:22.117
Right over here!

44:23.035 --> 44:24.620
- This is her! Take her!
- What…

44:24.703 --> 44:25.996
Get her out of here.

44:41.470 --> 44:44.598
Where am I?
Did they realize who I am?

44:45.182 --> 44:46.600
So, then, is this Songrim?

44:49.937 --> 44:51.313
Are you finally awake?

44:51.397 --> 44:53.732
Who are you? And where am I?

44:57.778 --> 45:00.698
The home of Master Jang Gang,
the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

45:01.281 --> 45:04.159
"Jang Gang"?
This is the house of the Jang family?

45:08.872 --> 45:12.334
I don't know why the Young Master
decided to bring someone so frail-looking

45:12.418 --> 45:13.335
into this house.

45:13.419 --> 45:15.921
- "Young Master"?
- That's right.

45:16.004 --> 45:17.840
Young Master Uk
of this house paid the brothel

45:17.923 --> 45:19.800
before bringing you back home with him.

45:19.883 --> 45:21.301
I heard that you…

45:21.385 --> 45:23.429
stole from the Young Master
at the brothel. Is that so?

45:25.431 --> 45:26.473
Take this instead.

45:27.933 --> 45:29.977
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa, hey!

45:30.936 --> 45:32.563
What does he want with me?

45:32.646 --> 45:35.649
I was quite worried when he said he was
bringing a girl home from the brothel.

45:36.275 --> 45:38.068
But now that I've seen you, I care less.

45:38.152 --> 45:39.820
He just brought you here out of pity.

45:40.612 --> 45:41.447
Here.

45:41.947 --> 45:42.906
Go! Get changed!

45:42.990 --> 45:44.199
Mu-deok, now.

45:44.283 --> 45:46.285
- What the hell is this?
- Really?

45:46.368 --> 45:48.162
Your uniform as
the Young Master's servant.

45:48.245 --> 45:52.291
Also, how dare you speak
like that to your elder, young lady!

45:53.083 --> 45:55.461
Young Master is very frail,

45:55.544 --> 45:57.296
so he gets tired very easily.

45:57.379 --> 46:00.340
So you need to do your tasks
as soon as the Young Master requests them.

46:00.424 --> 46:03.969
And also, regardless of what
he says to you, always smile.

46:05.179 --> 46:06.263
Do you understand me?

46:07.431 --> 46:08.265
Yes.

46:09.183 --> 46:10.017
Good.

46:10.100 --> 46:13.520
He wanted to see you as soon as
you woke up, so go get changed quickly.

46:13.604 --> 46:14.688
Understand?

46:15.397 --> 46:16.231
Yes…

46:17.691 --> 46:18.525
Missus.

46:20.194 --> 46:22.112
Please call me "ma'am",
nothing other than that.

46:26.533 --> 46:27.618
"The Young Master"?

46:29.036 --> 46:30.496
Why would he bring me here?

46:33.707 --> 46:34.792
Your beautiful eyes…

46:36.168 --> 46:37.419
Did he fall for me?

46:39.087 --> 46:40.214
For this ugly face?

46:42.090 --> 46:44.301
He has such a terrible taste.

46:51.391 --> 46:53.435
Regardless,
until I can regain my power,

46:53.519 --> 46:55.938
it might be safer if I just hide out here.

46:57.564 --> 47:01.610
If he really has fallen for this body,
at least I'll be treated well.

47:02.778 --> 47:03.904
So, then…

47:04.446 --> 47:08.242
at least while I'm here,
I will be Mu-deok.

47:09.618 --> 47:12.496
Young Master. Mu-deok is here.

47:13.497 --> 47:14.331
Come in.

47:25.676 --> 47:26.593
Young Master.

47:26.677 --> 47:28.720
I wanted to thank you
so much for saving my life.

47:28.804 --> 47:31.223
Thank you for bringing me here.

47:32.224 --> 47:34.351
It only took a few ordinary men
to drag you over here.

47:36.103 --> 47:38.730
- That's disappointing.
- I know that it was very rude of me

47:38.814 --> 47:40.941
to threaten you the way
I did with that crab leg,

47:41.775 --> 47:42.901
but please forgive me for it.

47:42.985 --> 47:44.486
You found some manners, I see!

47:44.570 --> 47:46.613
I'll serve you the best
that I possibly can.

47:47.322 --> 47:48.824
Fine, you go do your best.

47:48.907 --> 47:51.285
Mu-deok, go and fetch me
some water, please.

47:52.035 --> 47:53.203
Yes, Young Master.

48:00.460 --> 48:01.295
Hang on.

48:01.920 --> 48:03.797
Not drinking water, washing water.

48:04.548 --> 48:06.633
Ah, yes, Young Master.

48:11.179 --> 48:13.432
Instead of washing my face,
I'll just take a bath.

48:20.147 --> 48:21.523
Hot, hot!

48:21.607 --> 48:23.567
Gosh, this is far too hot!

48:25.235 --> 48:26.653
Yes, Young Master.

48:32.951 --> 48:34.453
Oh. It's cold.

48:35.037 --> 48:36.330
It's a bit too cold.

48:39.917 --> 48:41.084
It doesn't feel cold.

48:41.168 --> 48:43.545
It is. I'll get sick if I bathe in this.

48:45.380 --> 48:47.090
- What's with this asshole?
- It's freezing.

48:47.174 --> 48:48.425
Is he not in love with me?

48:48.508 --> 48:49.968
What? Are you gonna fix it?

48:51.178 --> 48:52.262
Yes, Young Master.

48:52.346 --> 48:54.389
I'll get some hot water.

49:00.228 --> 49:01.063
Salty.

49:01.146 --> 49:04.566
Oh! Too sweet. So spicy.
Too long. What is this thing?

49:04.650 --> 49:05.859
I won't eat this.

49:09.363 --> 49:11.073
This water smells kinda strange.

49:11.782 --> 49:12.699
Does it smell?

49:13.700 --> 49:14.993
Bring me a new bucket.

49:18.080 --> 49:19.790
I'll need a different blanket.

49:20.457 --> 49:22.250
I feel like I'll sleep better
with the blue blanket tonight.

49:44.523 --> 49:46.233
He doesn't even do a damn thing all day,

49:46.316 --> 49:48.485
and yet he still needs
to take three baths a day.

49:52.406 --> 49:53.573
I will kill him.

49:53.657 --> 49:57.285
When I regain my energy, he's going
to be the first person that I kill.

50:01.456 --> 50:03.959
Young Master, I brought you cold water.

50:04.751 --> 50:05.585
I have it here.

50:05.669 --> 50:07.379
Oh, good. The water finally cooled.

50:07.462 --> 50:08.922
Ah, just right!

50:10.382 --> 50:11.466
Great job…

50:11.550 --> 50:13.927
No, hold on! I was pointless, Mu-deok.

50:25.105 --> 50:26.523
If I had my power…

50:27.315 --> 50:30.569
if I had even a tenth of my energy
coursing through these hands…

50:44.624 --> 50:47.711
Hold on! What?
What… what is happening?

51:04.853 --> 51:06.063
Something funny?

51:07.481 --> 51:08.398
What?

51:09.441 --> 51:11.068
Why are you smiling at me like that, huh?

51:12.027 --> 51:13.153
It's nothing, Young Master.

51:13.236 --> 51:14.821
The water's refreshing.

51:15.781 --> 51:17.074
My clothes!

51:17.157 --> 51:18.408
Yes, Young Master.

51:27.334 --> 51:28.752
What are you doing?

51:29.294 --> 51:30.629
Oh, here you go.

51:33.590 --> 51:35.550
You can go. That's enough for today.

51:36.134 --> 51:37.260
Yes, Young Master.

51:49.231 --> 51:50.732
That was definitely a Spirit Plaque

51:50.816 --> 51:53.318
that could allow me to open
the barrier and enter Songrim.

51:55.237 --> 51:56.863
But I can't cast spells to help me break

51:56.947 --> 51:58.990
the barrier into Songrim
in my current state.

52:00.659 --> 52:02.202
I should find my sword.

52:03.453 --> 52:06.373
My power might return
if I can hold my sword.

52:09.709 --> 52:11.169
If I had the Spirit Plaque,

52:12.129 --> 52:14.673
nothing can stop me
from entering into Songrim now.

52:19.344 --> 52:22.681
SONGRIM

52:23.807 --> 52:27.102
So, how long do you plan on
keeping Naksu's body here?

52:27.769 --> 52:29.855
If she somehow successfully shifted souls,

52:30.397 --> 52:31.231
Naksu…

52:32.482 --> 52:33.900
will come to get her sword.

52:35.652 --> 52:38.947
Since her body is here,
she will surely come.

52:40.240 --> 52:42.159
So just wait and watch for the time being.

52:48.999 --> 52:52.294
Maybe it's just because
your father's room is always empty,

52:52.961 --> 52:54.588
but it never seems to get dusty.

52:55.839 --> 52:57.424
I wonder when he'll come back.

53:01.428 --> 53:04.890
The color in your mother's portrait
has faded quite a bit.

53:05.515 --> 53:07.559
We should call
for a painter to touch it up.

53:30.665 --> 53:33.126
I have memorized
every single book you told me to read.

53:33.710 --> 53:35.170
So, just like you and Dang-gu,

53:35.795 --> 53:37.797
please, let me study spells at Songrim.

53:46.014 --> 53:49.226
That sword there,
it belongs to your father.

53:49.309 --> 53:50.602
Now, take it out.

54:03.740 --> 54:05.367
But my gate of energy is blocked,

54:05.909 --> 54:08.161
I'm not able to unsheathe
a sword that has a spell on it.

54:08.912 --> 54:11.164
How can you expect
to learn how to cast any spells

54:11.248 --> 54:12.916
when you can't even unsheathe
your father's sword?

54:12.999 --> 54:15.877
As Songrim's leader,
can't you just open my gate of energy?

54:15.961 --> 54:16.878
No!

54:18.088 --> 54:19.464
I can't do that.

54:20.840 --> 54:21.675
Then…

54:22.550 --> 54:24.261
please go find me a new master that can.

54:24.970 --> 54:26.346
No master will ever help.

54:27.222 --> 54:29.599
There is no mage in Daeho
that would go against your father

54:29.683 --> 54:31.768
and dare to open
your gate of energy for you.

54:31.851 --> 54:33.186
Then what you're telling me…

54:34.271 --> 54:36.147
that it's impossible
for me, no matter what?

54:36.231 --> 54:38.817
That is the fate that your father…

54:39.776 --> 54:41.444
has determined for you.

54:42.404 --> 54:43.738
That's not fair!

54:44.364 --> 54:46.157
Why does he get to decide my future?

54:47.534 --> 54:49.911
No one even considers him
to be my father, anyway!

54:51.454 --> 54:52.664
I will find someone.

54:53.999 --> 54:57.794
A master who's willing to open up
my gate of energy and teach me.

54:58.837 --> 55:00.588
I will find someone on my own.

55:02.007 --> 55:04.384
And unsheathe that sword
so I can break it in half.

55:31.077 --> 55:33.121
I heard that
Uk was expelled again.

55:33.204 --> 55:36.333
How can the son of the great Lord
get away with behaving like that?

55:37.042 --> 55:38.335
Well, he's not his real son.

55:38.835 --> 55:41.671
I heard his mother,
the most beautiful woman in Daeho,

55:41.755 --> 55:44.215
slept with another man before Uk was born.

55:44.299 --> 55:45.717
I doubt that's true.

55:45.800 --> 55:49.179
Why not? Why else would he
block his own son's gate of energy

55:49.262 --> 55:50.722
and then run away?

55:52.015 --> 55:55.810
Did his father really do something to him?

56:05.779 --> 56:07.739
The Spirit Plaque should be
here somewhere.

56:22.045 --> 56:22.962
Where is it?

56:48.863 --> 56:50.824
Am I stupid? Why did I hide here?

56:50.907 --> 56:52.200
What will he think if he sees me?

56:53.701 --> 56:54.661
What will I say to him?

57:01.167 --> 57:03.837
I didn't bring you into my service
with this in mind.

57:05.839 --> 57:06.673
Well, uh…

57:07.340 --> 57:09.342
you kept telling me
how cold you were, Young Master.

57:09.426 --> 57:11.678
I thought that I could
warm up the bed for you.

57:12.178 --> 57:15.056
If you lay down right now, you can sleep
soundly as you'll be warm all night.

57:15.140 --> 57:16.349
Oh, really?

57:16.850 --> 57:17.809
Oh!

57:17.892 --> 57:19.060
That was kind of you.

57:23.523 --> 57:25.692
- Well, good night, then.
- Where are you going?

57:27.861 --> 57:29.237
You said you would
keep me warm, didn't you?

57:30.989 --> 57:31.865
Keep my bed

57:32.907 --> 57:34.075
nice and hot…

57:35.410 --> 57:36.327
all night.

57:38.621 --> 57:39.789
Warm it up.

57:44.043 --> 57:46.588
What?
Is he really in love with me?

57:47.297 --> 57:48.882
Did I fall into his trap?

57:57.307 --> 57:58.141
Young Master…

57:59.100 --> 58:01.686
my body won't produce
enough heat to keep you warm.

58:01.769 --> 58:03.771
Ever since I was a child,
I easily get cold.

58:03.855 --> 58:06.274
So my body is always unbearably frigid.

58:28.463 --> 58:31.466
I refuse to do whatever sick thing
you're trying to get me to do.

58:41.351 --> 58:43.728
Could you just bring
the brazier over here already?

58:47.607 --> 58:48.775
The brazier?

58:48.858 --> 58:52.403
Yeah, I just want you to bring
the brazier, so it's right next to my bed,

58:52.487 --> 58:53.571
so I stay warm.

58:55.740 --> 58:56.699
Oh.

58:57.909 --> 58:58.826
Stay warm.

59:06.000 --> 59:06.876
Here you go.

59:07.460 --> 59:09.254
Hey, if it's that close, it will be too…

59:10.672 --> 59:12.131
It will get too hot, right?

59:12.924 --> 59:15.009
Ah, oh, way… way too hot.

59:19.097 --> 59:20.807
Stay there
and keep the fire going all night.

59:20.890 --> 59:22.559
I promise I'll sell you if it goes out.

59:22.642 --> 59:23.768
Yes, Young Master.

59:35.655 --> 59:38.866
Hey! All right, all right.
Dang-gu is here.

59:42.495 --> 59:44.706
What is that? Oh, it's a whistle.

59:45.415 --> 59:46.291
Mm.

59:47.250 --> 59:48.918
I believe that I actually made this.

59:49.002 --> 59:52.213
Oh, that's right, that's right.
You had a pet bird, right?

59:52.297 --> 59:54.132
Are you getting a new one?

59:55.383 --> 59:58.303
No, not that. I just found it
with someone I didn't expect.

59:59.846 --> 01:00:01.472
I wonder why she ended up with it.

01:00:02.098 --> 01:00:03.391
Did you give it to her?

01:00:03.975 --> 01:00:06.060
Hey, maybe you just forgot all about it.

01:00:06.144 --> 01:00:07.228
Can't be.

01:00:08.104 --> 01:00:10.273
I clearly remember
the person that I gave this to.

01:00:27.498 --> 01:00:30.293
Well, then, just go and ask her.

01:00:37.508 --> 01:00:39.886
Are you really going to do it right now?

01:00:39.969 --> 01:00:41.304
I need a closer look at something.

01:02:36.627 --> 01:02:38.087
Who are these people?

01:02:53.644 --> 01:02:54.479
Stop!

01:02:55.772 --> 01:02:56.814
We have intruders!

01:02:57.565 --> 01:02:58.858
Intruders!

01:03:57.291 --> 01:03:58.209
Go back.

01:04:29.574 --> 01:04:30.658
Step aside!

01:05:11.198 --> 01:05:12.283
Yul.

01:05:12.867 --> 01:05:13.784
What's going on here?

01:05:17.371 --> 01:05:19.415
The Training Center has been set on fire.

01:05:26.797 --> 01:05:28.507
Is there anyone at Jeongjingak now?

01:05:28.591 --> 01:05:30.092
Master Yul and Dang-gu
should still be there.

01:05:33.304 --> 01:05:34.680
Uncle Jin, are you okay?

01:05:35.890 --> 01:05:37.683
The intruders have all fled from here.

01:05:39.268 --> 01:05:40.978
So, Jeongjingak is empty.

01:05:51.656 --> 01:05:53.074
- Go after them.
- Sir!

01:06:03.751 --> 01:06:04.961
Who were those men?

01:06:06.253 --> 01:06:08.172
Did the Danju send them here?

01:06:10.132 --> 01:06:11.759
The one whose soul you must collect

01:06:11.842 --> 01:06:14.637
this time is Park Jin,
the leader of Songrim.

01:06:18.432 --> 01:06:19.350
Right.

01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:22.895
The Danju must have sent them
to come get my body.

01:06:30.695 --> 01:06:31.529
Who is there?

01:07:05.187 --> 01:07:06.063
Young Master?

01:07:20.494 --> 01:07:21.746
What are you doing here?

01:07:25.332 --> 01:07:26.459
Because of your eyes.

01:07:27.626 --> 01:07:28.502
Eyes?

01:07:51.192 --> 01:07:52.485
I knew you'd be my master…

01:07:55.654 --> 01:07:56.822
as soon as I saw that.

01:08:40.658 --> 01:08:44.036
A soul shifter.
The Shadow Assassin, Naksu.

01:08:44.120 --> 01:08:46.288
I have been searching all over
to find the greatest master to serve.

01:08:46.372 --> 01:08:48.332
The one who'll open my gate of energy.

01:08:48.415 --> 01:08:49.959
I want you to be my master.

01:08:50.042 --> 01:08:51.669
I would never have imagined such nonsense.

01:08:51.752 --> 01:08:54.713
One of Naksu's men is in here.
They're going to catch him.

01:08:54.797 --> 01:08:58.676
As of now,
we'll seek out that soul shifter.

01:08:59.385 --> 01:09:01.387
Pretend you know nothing,
even if they catch me.

01:09:02.680 --> 01:09:04.431
Stay right by my side.

01:09:05.099 --> 01:09:06.892
Throughout my life,
I've only met those

01:09:06.976 --> 01:09:08.060
who have wanted me dead.

01:09:09.353 --> 01:09:13.274
You are the first person
who's ever tried… to save my life.

01:09:13.941 --> 01:09:16.193
Even if you come this close to me again,

01:09:16.277 --> 01:09:18.237
I promise I will spare you.
